From ac1958c380cfa9443687b19c4cdea16ef6db80ec Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: gw-fix-bot <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 25 Aug 2026 02:48:04 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] fix(gw+vless): clean-upgrade fallback for GW injector, full
 Xray config for VLESS
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

GW HTTP-Injector tunnel (PayloadInjector): two-stage connect (author payload
first, clean WebSocket-upgrade fallback when the gateway rejects the decoy and
closes); fast-fail on Connection: close; TLS only for https/:443 proxies.
VLESS/Xray (VlessParser): dns + sniffing + routing + empty tcpSettings, and
flow=xtls-rprx-vision only on network=tcp.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
